<!--
woo:testWooAiStudioLauncher (RETIRED #424 — PoC-0 view 정본)
====================================================================
#421–422 launcher 경로 폐기. ACC Input forms 에 등록돼 있으면 Console 에서 삭제.
-->
<form _cs="Test Woo AI Studio Launcher (woo)" img="xtk:form.png"
      label="Test Woo AI Studio" name="testWooAiStudioLauncher"
      namespace="woo" xtkschema="xtk:form"
      nothingToEdit="true" nothingToSave="true" colcount="1">

  <enter>
    <set expr="$(serverUrl) + '/woo/testWooAiStudio.jssp?embed=1&amp;v=212&amp;__sessiontoken=' + $(sessionToken) + '&amp;__securitytoken=' + $(securityToken)"
         xpath="/tmp/@twStudioUrl"/>
  </enter>

  <input colspan="1" label="Studio URL (diag)" readOnly="true" xpath="/tmp/@twStudioUrl"/>
  <container colspan="1" height="700" name="twStudioShell" nolabel="true">
    <input colspan="1" nolabel="true" sessionToken="true" type="UrlViewer" urlMode="true"
           urlExpr="[/tmp/@twStudioUrl]"/>
  </container>

</form>
